@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap dang mo -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Chi tiet bai tap 1 -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Nop bai hop le cho bai tap 1 -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/EduSubmit"
}

### 6. Doc lai luot nop vua tao qua Location -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Doc luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Nop trung bai tap da nop -> 409 Conflict + ApiError
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/EduSubmit"
}

### 9. Nop thieu thong tin -> 400 Bad Request + ApiError
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 10. Nop vao bai tap da dong -> 400 Bad Request + ApiError
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv002/EduSubmit"
}

### 11. Xoa luot nop (Bai mo rong) -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 12. Xoa lai luot nop da xoa -> 404 Not Found
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
